 "Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette - join the {Brand} live floor now.": {"de":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — jetzt auf den {Brand}-Live-Floor.","ru":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — заходите на лайв-пол {Brand}.","uk":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — заходьте на лайв-підлогу {Brand}.","pl":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — dołącz do live {Brand}.","es":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette: entra al piso en vivo de {Brand}.","pt":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — entre no piso ao vivo da {Brand}.","fr":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — rejoignez le floor live {Brand}.","it":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — entra nel floor live {Brand}.","tr":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — {Brand} canlı kata katılın.","nl":"Crazy Time, Mega Wheel, Lightning Roulette — ga naar de livevloer van {Brand}."},
